[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは――",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010130,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが書類審査で選んだ\r\n風野灯織さんですね！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010140,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "彼女にはもうレッスンスタジオに入ってもらっていますので\r\n今から顔合わせに行きましょう！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1901001010140"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {},
  {},
  {},
  {
    "bgEffect": "mask",
    "bg": "00014",
    "bgm": "015",
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（えっと、たしか……\r\nあのダンスレッスンをしてる子だよな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ワン、ツー、スリー……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0121",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "君、ちょっといいかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charCategory": "stand_jersey",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "！　もしかして、プロデューサーですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今日から君をプロデュースさせてもらうことになったんだ\r\nよろしく頼むな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……風野灯織です\r\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うーん……礼儀正しいが、どうも距離があるな……\r\nよし、ここは……！）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "レッスン、すごく頑張ってるみたいだし\r\n君は努力家なんだな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（な、なんだ？　機嫌が悪くなったような……）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "少し見ただけでわかるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、なんでもありません\r\n……レッスンに戻ります",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……行ってしまった）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アーアーアーアーアー♪",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002001010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……もっとお腹に力を入れないと……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200101/1002001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（一切手を抜かない姿勢……\r\nやっぱり、クールだけどすごく真面目な子だ）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、これからプロデュース頑張るぞ！）",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]